  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Water Initiatives of Tajikistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall Objective of the project to provide support in organization of the third International Conference within the framework of the International Decade for Action &#x201c;Water for Sustainable Development&#x201d;, 2018-2028, to be held on 10-13 June 2024 in Dushanbe.The expected Impact of the project is the contribution to maintaining the leadership of the country on the water agenda and to encourage the stewardship of Tajikistan on water and on other relevant development issues.</narrative>
  </description>
